# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Several build scripts (e.g.
# Build-EffectParameters.ps1, Build-HardwareConfig.ps1) splice generated
# blocks into existing files using bare LF; with core.autocrlf=true this
# produced mixed CRLF/LF files that Git perpetually reported as modified
# even though the content was identical (see git diff vs. git status).
* text=auto eol=lf